WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
- Do you have time to play with your kids

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.020
or are you too busy?

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.460
- Oh, yeah, we play, yeah.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.020
I hang out with them, we go to.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.240
I do all the soccer games and stuff.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.557
But I had to learn how to play.

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:13.490
White people, y'all have
so much playtime, man.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.720
Y'all is just frivolous play.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.870
- I like to get busy.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.160
- Yeah, black people always
waiting for something to happen.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.893
We always on bull-point like ...

00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:23.992
(laughing)

00:00:23.992 --> 00:00:27.590
Good, but it's always
playing going on in my house,

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.133
so I had to get used to that.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:30.750
Black people don't play.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.120
That's just how we were raised, no.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.820
- You do jigsaw puzzles.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:35.790
- Well that's different.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.320
While I'm doing the jigsaw puzzle,

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.670
I'm also looking around
seeing what's going on.

